# The two bundled JavaScript files are build artefacts whose md5 is recorded in
# CHANGELOG.md, and `assets/bugbottle.js` is a byte-for-byte copy of a released
# file. Marking them `-text` stops git rewriting their line endings on checkout
# on Windows, which would change the hash of the file a reader is asked to
# verify. The compiled catalogue is binary for the same reason.
assets/bugbottle.js -text
assets/bugbottle-screenshot.js -text
languages/*.mo binary
